sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户提问
    participant Agent as Agent 核心调度器
    participant Registry as ToolRegistry (分发机)
    participant Model as 智谱 BigModel

    User->>Agent: "查询员工 101 并计算其税后收入"
    Agent->>Model: 发送请求 + Tools JSON Schema 列表
    Model-->>Agent: 返回 tool_calls: [get_user_info(user_id=101)]
    Agent->>Registry: dispatch("get_user_info", {"user_id": 101})
    Registry-->>Agent: 返回结果: "张三 (架构师)"
    Agent->>Model: 将结果作为 role: "tool" 消息回填
    Model-->>Agent: 综合工具结果输出自然语言回复
    Agent-->>User: "员工 101 是张三，其税后收入为..."
